WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.694 --> 00:00:02.954 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
안녕하세요. 저는

2
00:00:02.954 --> 00:00:05.034 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
예술과 대중을 연결하는

3
00:00:05.034 --> 00:00:06.654 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
