5
00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.724 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
사실 너무 자연스러운 지금 상황이라

6
00:00:13.724 --> 00:00:16.504 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
