11
00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:30.602 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
그런 커뮤니티가 좀 셌었거든요.

12
00:00:31.002 --> 00:00:33.502 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
